Scope

This addon is forked from the radial menu of FlareUI
(https://github.com/malkkav/FlareUI), whose source code is MIT licensed as
above. FlareUI's Media/Art, Media/Bars and Media/Icons are not licensed for
reuse, and none of them is included here. Four textures in art/radial come from
FlareUI's Media/Radial, which its license covers: Divider, SliceGlow, HalfMask
and Dot. The others are AhryMX's, drawn by MedalUI's art/radial/gen_radial.py.
